Every headless test compiles the service container again: container caching is
off under CIVICRM_UF=UnitTests. The container is compiled once per test process
and environment instead (59 headless tests: 27.9 s -> 25.4 s CPU, -9 %); each
boot gets a fresh instance, and a test that listens to a compile hook still gets
its own.

Upstream: https://github.com/civicrm/civicrm-core/pull/37835

